   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Studijn&#xe1; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva - antiplagi&#xe1;tosk&#xfd; detek&#x10d;n&#xfd; syst&#xe9;m</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit - anti-plagiarism detection system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Prim&#xe1;rnym cie&#x13e;om &#x161;tudijnej n&#xe1;v&#x161;tevy Centra vedecko-technick&#xfd;ch inform&#xe1;ci&#xed; SR&#xa0;bolo obozn&#xe1;menie sa so slovensk&#xfd;mi sk&#xfa;senos&#x165;ami zo zav&#xe1;dzania a fungovania celo&#x161;t&#xe1;tneho antiplagi&#xe1;torsk&#xe9;ho detek&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho syst&#xe9;mu, a&#xa0;to z&#xa0;technickej i&#xa0;administrat&#xed;vnej str&#xe1;nky.&#xa0;&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Druh&#xfd;m &#xfa;&#x10d;elom n&#xe1;v&#x161;tevy je v&#xfd;mena sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; so zav&#xe1;dzan&#xed;m informa&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch technol&#xf3;gi&#xed; do vysoko&#x161;kolsk&#xe9;ho vzdel&#xe1;vania a populariz&#xe1;cia technick&#xfd;ch odborov.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The primary objective of the study visit in the Centre of Scientific and Technical Information was familiarization with Slovak experience in the implementation and operation of the nationwide anti-plagiarism detection system, both technically and administratively.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The second purpose of the visit is to exchange experience with the introduction of information technology in higher education and popularization of technical disciplines&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
